# The siege arm with a roof: arty + AA turrets over the extractors, and
# NOTHING else standing -- cover stays off, so the ground-turret waste that
# cover24-hard refuted never rides along. The AA branch runs before the
# cover gate, so this combination is exactly "turrets that shoot up, only
# once aircraft have been shown, and no others".
#
# screen-vh9's strangled seed loses half its economy to one air strike at
# ~sample 1400 (log 2026-07-31). aa_cover was refuted at Hard -- where the
# enemy rarely fields air -- but Very Hard's 1.8x income reaches an air
# fleet reliably. The narrow question: does a roof over the extractors stop
# the strike that decides the match?

name aa-counter-guard-arty-aa
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
